// waking from being discarded, or whose service-worker-side message port
// hasn't finished opening yet - this is the actual cause of "Could not
// establish connection" being intermittent rather than consistent (the tab
// and content.js are fine; the message just landed in a half-second gap).
// Retrying a few times with short, growing gaps absorbs that race without
// resorting to a full page reload.
