// Pull a YYYY-MM-DD..YYYY-MM-DD range out of a filename, e.g.
// "meesho_PREVIOUS_PAYMENT_2026-03-01_2026-03-31.zip".
// Claims/Returns (returnRto endpoint) instead name files
